      "created_at": "2023-09-14T03:44:56.217Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Employee advance accounts act as receivable account, if its salary advance you have to deduct when you post salary entries, if its iou type payment you have to settle it when employee present the expenses details together with supporting untill settle it is receivable</p>",
