      "name": "Oscar Utomo",
      "created_at": "2023-09-14T03:49:05.232Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I used receivable account earlier, but when there is a Return, the Payment Entry showing error because “Employee” doctype should be Payable, not Receieveable whereas when I create a new employee advance, it is treated as Employee Receivable. So in my case, when i’m using Receieveable account, 100% of the amount should be settled as employee claim. it is not allowed to Return the employee advance.</p>",
