    {
      "id": 377870,
      "username": "oscarutomo",
      "name": "Oscar Utomo",
      "created_at": "2023-09-29T09:03:19.615Z",
      "cooked": "<p><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/a/8/a82db2d452aced53140cc97553e251a33f39ef86.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"nZM7FCQbtSonFoWnQK8fSIb9q50\" width=\"396\" height=\"290\"><br>\nSaya pakai seperti ini pak… tipe nya betul Cash.</p>\n<p>Nanti ketika Employee Advance, Advance Account-nya diisi itu:<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/a/6/a613c4e5aefacfeaa6aedd59cef9413eccbd3175.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/a613c4e5aefacfeaa6aedd59cef9413eccbd3175\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/6/a613c4e5aefacfeaa6aedd59cef9413eccbd3175_2_690x348.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"nHbC93A6ZYIRQVcIJqZCIN39fH7\" width=\"690\" height=\"348\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/6/a613c4e5aefacfeaa6aedd59cef9413eccbd3175_2_690x348.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/6/a613c4e5aefacfeaa6aedd59cef9413eccbd3175_2_1035x522.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/a/6/a613c4e5aefacfeaa6aedd59cef9413eccbd3175.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F9FAFA\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1276×645 26.5 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>\n<p>GL nya nanti seperti ini pak:<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/7/4/74e38cb045d13023732bafad108e636d08d9f661.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/74e38cb045d13023732bafad108e636d08d9f661\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/4/74e38cb045d13023732bafad108e636d08d9f661_2_690x37.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"gG2UndyCNBlZAlPWB9HEsToqXQd\" width=\"690\" height=\"37\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/4/74e38cb045d13023732bafad108e636d08d9f661_2_690x37.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/4/74e38cb045d13023732bafad108e636d08d9f661_2_1035x55.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/7/4/74e38cb045d13023732bafad108e636d08d9f661.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F5F5F5\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1258×68 12.5 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>\n<p>Di titik ini kan ada 2 kemungkinan:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Expense Claim</li>\n<li>Advance di Return</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Case 1:<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/2/c/2cdd1c5bb5ef4d9d14075bcdeac7746899627ce9.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/2cdd1c5bb5ef4d9d14075bcdeac7746899627ce9\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/2/c/2cdd1c5bb5ef4d9d14075bcdeac7746899627ce9.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"6oSJEwByaDWh5OpWI0NhPUK2CKt\" width=\"690\" height=\"53\" data-dominant-color=\"F6F6F6\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">819×63 7.41 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div><br>\nGL nya nanti seperti itu pak</p>\n<p>Case 2:<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/4/f/4f4771ee4aa61bd942c156be6e62978db06c55b9.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/4f4771ee4aa61bd942c156be6e62978db06c55b9\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/4/f/4f4771ee4aa61bd942c156be6e62978db06c55b9.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"bjkN0xnr9VrTDwIs1iOmy8XVv3r\" width=\"690\" height=\"44\" data-dominant-color=\"F5F5F5\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">897×58 8.41 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div><br>\nGL nya seperti itu</p>\n<p>At the end, Kas Advance nya Rp 0. Jadi memang tipenya Cash tapi treament nya seperti Receivable. harus 0 diakhir</p>",
