      "id": 483312,
      "username": "PhuongDong",
      "name": "",
      "created_at": "2025-10-07T07:39:22.493Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/oscarutomo\">@oscarutomo</a> , thank you for your reply.<br>\nHere is the accounting ledger for full flow from Employee Advance (Payment Entry) → Expense Claim → Employee Advance (Return)</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Employee Advance (Payment Entry)<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/c/8/c8ec9236b89cea856d0d57a36435a0c07381345f.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/c8ec9236b89cea856d0d57a36435a0c07381345f\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/c/8/c8ec9236b89cea856d0d57a36435a0c07381345f_2_690x141.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"sFslpR071g6fhmQeIbRgmspZC8L\" width=\"690\" height=\"141\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/c/8/c8ec9236b89cea856d0d57a36435a0c07381345f_2_690x141.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/c/8/c8ec9236b89cea856d0d57a36435a0c07381345f_2_1035x211.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/c/8/c8ec9236b89cea856d0d57a36435a0c07381345f_2_1380x282.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F6F6F6\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1402×288 29.5 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></li>\n<li>Expense Claim<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/0/e/0ed90f8a25cfd5cc8951b6cf1c72c83b214bfa2d.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/0ed90f8a25cfd5cc8951b6cf1c72c83b214bfa2d\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/0/e/0ed90f8a25cfd5cc8951b6cf1c72c83b214bfa2d_2_690x185.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"27lJzjRYkuDNVEff8IQ0boZrRYp\" width=\"690\" height=\"185\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/0/e/0ed90f8a25cfd5cc8951b6cf1c72c83b214bfa2d_2_690x185.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/0/e/0ed90f8a25cfd5cc8951b6cf1c72c83b214bfa2d_2_1035x277.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/0/e/0ed90f8a25cfd5cc8951b6cf1c72c83b214bfa2d.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F5F5F5\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1306×352 33.1 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></li>\n<li>Employee Advance (Return) - Employee should return to accounting department but not deduct to Employee salary<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/8/5/856208c4683aaf89ca8de5ce72d71dd7a266a0fe.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/856208c4683aaf89ca8de5ce72d71dd7a266a0fe\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/8/5/856208c4683aaf89ca8de5ce72d71dd7a266a0fe_2_690x108.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"j1XxxvvQWjDGILqRMDkuvEG97Ai\" width=\"690\" height=\"108\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/8/5/856208c4683aaf89ca8de5ce72d71dd7a266a0fe_2_690x108.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/8/5/856208c4683aaf89ca8de5ce72d71dd7a266a0fe_2_1035x162.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/8/5/856208c4683aaf89ca8de5ce72d71dd7a266a0fe_2_1380x216.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F9F9F9\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1776×279 27.1 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></li>\n</ol>\n<p>And the issue here is: when I submit ledger <span class=\"hashtag-raw\">#3</span> - Employee Advance Return, system pop up below error message</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/0/a/0aed854f47a91f9b134e1e21411be4983af6cf27.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/0aed854f47a91f9b134e1e21411be4983af6cf27\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/0/a/0aed854f47a91f9b134e1e21411be4983af6cf27.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"1yFEX8nEaq6mPMk50s051Xotfgj\" width=\"690\" height=\"158\" data-dominant-color=\"F8F8F8\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">811×186 7.65 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>Account Type for acct 12300 is Receivable, and for Party Type: Employee is Payable</p>\n<p>Can you explain or provide full flow ledger when using ‘Cash Advance’? I appreciate your support.</p>",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/p/ec9cab/{size}.png",
