    {
      "id": 483605,
      "username": "PhuongDong",
      "name": "",
      "created_at": "2025-10-10T06:24:00.497Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Thank you for your quick reply.<br>\nI’ve changed Account Type from Receivable to Cash and tried to create ‘Employee Advance’ but system show this error message.</p>\n<p>This account is configured under Company, and system requires a Receivable account as well.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/a/2/a2292e0bdfd91fc2b9334fa18420121fbf22a8ae.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/a2292e0bdfd91fc2b9334fa18420121fbf22a8ae\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/a/2/a2292e0bdfd91fc2b9334fa18420121fbf22a8ae.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"n8xzOA0GQatCgot6FxQq270AdoG\" width=\"595\" height=\"145\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">595×145 9.06 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>Did you face with this issue or how do you record employee advance?</p>",
