      "created_at": "2025-10-10T07:01:39.832Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi All</p>\n<p>The Employee Advance Account treatment as Receivable has been published recently by Frappe.</p>\n<aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://frappe.io/blog/product-updates/product-updates-for-september-2025\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n      <img src=\"https://frappe.io/files/frappeio82a788.ico\" class=\"site-icon\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://frappe.io/blog/product-updates/product-updates-for-september-2025\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">frappe.io</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <div class=\"aspect-image\" style=\"--aspect-ratio:690/336;\"><img src=\"https://frappe.io/files/Frame%20(6).png\" class=\"thumbnail\" width=\"690\" height=\"336\"></div>\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://frappe.io/blog/product-updates/product-updates-for-september-2025\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Product Updates for September 2025 | Frappe Blog</a></h3>\n\n  <p>Aftermath of Frappeverse</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/e/3/e337a77dd071a8b77e02e03246a6d3496433b016.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/e337a77dd071a8b77e02e03246a6d3496433b016\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/e/3/e337a77dd071a8b77e02e03246a6d3496433b016_2_690x396.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"wq3CIAdChMJRYdbVZyspbLdIynI\" width=\"690\" height=\"396\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/e/3/e337a77dd071a8b77e02e03246a6d3496433b016_2_690x396.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/e/3/e337a77dd071a8b77e02e03246a6d3496433b016_2_1035x594.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/e/3/e337a77dd071a8b77e02e03246